<% content_for(:html_title) { "Visualizer | 2025 Year in Coffee" } %>
<div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center sm:mt-6 sm:px-6 lg:mt-8 lg:px-8 dark:text-neutral-200">
  <div class="w-full space-y-10 sm:space-y-12">
    <% if @yearly_brew.shots_this_year.any? %>
      <%= render "yearly_brew/stats_2025", personal: true %>
      <% if Current.user.public? %>
        <div class="flex justify-center">
          <%= link_to yearly_brew_path(Current.user.slug, 2025), class: "inline-flex items-center gap-x-2 rounded-full bg-terracotta-600 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-md shadow-neutral-900/20 hover:bg-terracotta-500 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-terracotta-600 dark:shadow-black/40" do %>
            <svg class="-ml-0.5 size-5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M13 4.5a2.5 2.5 0 11.702 1.737L6.97 9.604a2.518 2.518 0 010 .792l6.733 3.367a2.5 2.5 0 11-.671 1.341l-6.733-3.367a2.5 2.5 0 110-3.475l6.733-3.366A2.52 2.52 0 0113 4.5z" />
            </svg>
            View your public page
          <% end %>
        </div>
      <% else %>
        <div class="flex max-w-prose flex-col items-center gap-y-3 text-center">
          <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">
            Want to show off your year in coffee?
            <%= link_to "Make your profile public", edit_profile_path, class: "standard-link text-terracotta-600 dark:text-terracotta-400" %>
            to get a shareable Bean Counting page.
          </p>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    <% else %>
      <div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-linear-to-br from-indigo-950 via-rose-700 to-amber-300 shadow-2xl shadow-neutral-900/10 sm:rounded-3xl">
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-50">
          <div class="absolute top-6 -left-20 h-56 w-56 rounded-full bg-amber-200/30 blur-3xl dark:bg-amber-800/30"></div>
          <div class="absolute right-6 bottom-0 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-sky-200/30 blur-3xl"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="relative px-6 py-10 sm:px-12 sm:py-14 lg:px-16">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between">
            <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-4">
              <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-white uppercase">
                <span class="inline-block size-2 rounded-full bg-amber-300"></span>
                Year in Review · 2025
              </div>
              <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl leading-tight font-semibold text-white sm:text-5xl">
                Daily Grind 2025
              </h2>
              <p class="text-base leading-7 text-white/90 sm:text-lg">
                You didn't upload any shots in 2025, but there’s a brand new year ahead. Be sure to log some in 2026 so you’ll be ready for the next Year in Review.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="mx-auto mt-16 mb-6 flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 dark:text-neutral-200">
  <h2 class="pb-6 font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">Thank you for the first 5! 🙏</h2>
  <div class="prose-neutral gap-y-3 prose text-neutral-700 dark:prose-invert dark:text-neutral-300">
    <p>
      2025 has been an absolutely incredible year for Visualizer. There were so many changes and improvements that even I can barely keep track:
      <a href="/updates/new-year-new-changes" target="_blank" class="standard-link text-terracotta-600 dark:text-terracotta-400">Push notifications</a>,
      <a href="/updates/lemon-squeezy-migration" target="_blank" class="standard-link text-terracotta-600 dark:text-terracotta-400">migration to Lemon Squeezy</a>,
      <a href="/updates/on-migration-and-other-updates" target="_blank" class="standard-link text-terracotta-600 dark:text-terracotta-400">quick shot compare</a>,
      <a href="/updates/spring-smooth-sailing" target="_blank" class="standard-link text-terracotta-600 dark:text-terracotta-400">support for Gaggiuino</a> and
      <a href="/updates/loffee-labs-integration" target="_blank" class="standard-link text-terracotta-600 dark:text-terracotta-400">GagiMate</a>,
      <a href="/updates/tagging-ux-gets-an-upgrade" target="_blank" class="standard-link text-terracotta-600 dark:text-terracotta-400">tagging improvements</a>,
      <a href="/updates/loffee-labs-integration" target="_blank" class="standard-link text-terracotta-600 dark:text-terracotta-400">integration with Loffee Labs</a>,
      including on <a href="/updates/loffee-labs-meets-coffee-management" target="_blank" class="standard-link text-terracotta-600 dark:text-terracotta-400">Coffee Management</a>
      which also got <a href="/updates/new-database-server-and-coffee-bag-archiving" target="_blank" class="standard-link text-terracotta-600 dark:text-terracotta-400">bag archiving</a>
      and a <a href="/updates/new-and-improved-coffee-bags-management" target="_blank" class="standard-link text-terracotta-600 dark:text-terracotta-400">complete redesign</a>,
      <a href="/updates/passkeys-come-to-visualizer" target="_blank" class="standard-link text-terracotta-600 dark:text-terracotta-400">Passkeys</a>,
      <a href="/updates/manage-dropdown-values" target="_blank" class="standard-link text-terracotta-600 dark:text-terracotta-400">managing dropdown values</a>, and so many more smaller improvements and bug fixes.
    </p>
    <p>
      None of this would have been possible without you. Without users, especially without <%= link_to "premium users", premium_index_path, class: "standard-link text-terracotta-600 dark:text-terracotta-400" %>, this project would have been long dead.
      But because of you, it's been alive and kicking for <strong>over 5 years</strong>! I know it sounds cheesy at this point, but I honestly can't thank you enough.
      Even in my wildest dreams I never expected this little fun side project to have over <strong>6,500 users</strong> and <strong>3.6 million uploaded shots</strong>.
      Absolute insanity. 🤯
    </p>
    <p>
      But here we are, five incredible years in.
      The pace of growth and the constant flow of ideas have kept this project exciting in ways I never expected.
      And I’m already looking forward to what the next years will bring.
    </p>
    <p>
      Once again, my friend <a href="https://banibeans.si/" class="standard-link text-terracotta-600 dark:text-terracotta-400" target="_blank">Luka (Banibeans)</a> has a special offer for Visualizer users.
      This year, when you use <code class="rounded bg-neutral-200 px-1 text-neutral-800 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-100">VISUALIZER10</code>, you not only get a 10% discount, but he also promised he'll throw in an extra 100g of something very tasty.
    </p>
    <p>
      And whether you're decorating a tree, lighting candles, raising an aluminum pole, or just catching your breath, I wish you wonderful holidays filled with great coffee and even better company. 🥂
    </p>
    <p>Miha</p>
  </div>
</div>
